  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DA">Exchange project to enhance the understanding between students in th Global North and South and to gain insight in the different issues in the two countries with regards to
&#x2022;  Climate change issues and green energy production
&#x2022;  Sustainable plastic production and use
&#x2022;  Plastic waste upcycling as a channel for civic engagement
This is particularly related to SDGs 11 and 17 but also relates to SDGs 4, 7 and 12.
The three-phase project started in Jan 2023. 
We are seeking financial support for phase 2: Egyptian students visiting Denmark.</narrative>
  </description>
